 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Phone pe koi bole, aap digital arrest mein ho? Ruko. Supreme Court ne RBI se kaha hai: bank ki laaparwahi se fraud hua, toh bank victim ko kam se kam utna paisa lautaye jitna gaya.",
   "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/476f8cb8-8b73-5183-8bf5-4bbd7da9feab/scratchpad/r1115/l1.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Par ye abhi RBI ka niyam nahi bana, isliye bachaav aapke haath mein hai. Pehli baat: kanoon mein digital arrest jaisa kuch nahi hota. Video call pe koi police arrest nahi karti.",
   "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/476f8cb8-8b73-5183-8bf5-4bbd7da9feab/scratchpad/r1115/l2.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Doosri baat: call kaato, aur khud family ya local police se baat karo. Teesri baat: paisa chala gaya, toh turant 1930 pe call karo, aur bank ko bhi batao.",
   "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/476f8cb8-8b73-5183-8bf5-4bbd7da9feab/scratchpad/r1115/l3.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ek simple rule banao: ghabrahat mein koi payment nahi. Ye reel save karo, aur ghar ke bado ko bhejo.",
   "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/476f8cb8-8b73-5183-8bf5-4bbd7da9feab/scratchpad/r1115/l4.wav"
  }
 ],
